<title>PHILIPPINES: BASKETBALL-PHILIPPINE PRO-LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-PHILIPPINE PRO-LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semi-final round games played on late Sunday in the Philippine Basketball Association second conference, which includes American players:</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Ginebra San Miguel 89-86 (45-46 half-time)</p>
</text>
